  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to Phase 2 of the IMF AFRITAC South to provide specialist IMF technical advice and guidance to targeted beneficiary countries.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Funding to Phase 2 of the IMF AFRITAC South to provide specialist IMF technical advice and guidance to targeted beneficiary countries. is a component of Support to the IMF Africa Regional Technical Assistance Center (AFRITAC) South reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,120,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Public finance management (PFM), Financial policy and administrative management, Domestic revenue mobilisation, Monetary institutions, Education/training in banking and financial services, Statistical capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
